# A phone's sheet: every page, the way a finger reaches it.
start shell
ipc sidebar open settings; pause 1.2; shot sheet-settings
ipc sidebar open notifications; pause 1.2; shot sheet-notifications
ipc sidebar open tasks; pause 1.2; shot sheet-tasks
ipc sidebar open calendar; pause 1.2; shot sheet-calendar
ipc sidebar open assistant; pause 1.2; shot sheet-assistant
ipc sidebar open drop; pause 1.2; shot sheet-drop
